    <h2 id="switch">Switch</h2>
    <p>An Aqua-style toggle switch with a glassy thumb. Add <code>.aqua-switch--checked</code> for the on state.</p>

    <%- example(`
      [[<div class="demo-row demo-row--tight">]]
        <button type="button" class="aqua-switch" role="switch" aria-checked="false">
          <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="aqua-switch aqua-switch--checked" role="switch" aria-checked="true">
          <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
        </button>
      [[</div>]]
    `) %>

    <h3>Sizes</h3>
    <p>Use <code>.aqua-switch--small</code> or <code>.aqua-switch--large</code> to adjust the size.</p>

    <%- example(`
      [[<div class="demo-row demo-row--tight">]]
        <button type="button" class="aqua-switch aqua-switch--small aqua-switch--checked" role="switch" aria-checked="true">
          <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="aqua-switch aqua-switch--checked" role="switch" aria-checked="true">
          <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="aqua-switch aqua-switch--large aqua-switch--checked" role="switch" aria-checked="true">
          <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
        </button>
      [[</div>]]
    `) %>

    <h3>With Label</h3>
    <p>Wrap the switch in <code>.aqua-switch-wrapper</code> and place an <code>.aqua-switch-label</code> next to it.</p>

    <%- example(`
      <div class="aqua-switch-wrapper">
        <button type="button" class="aqua-switch aqua-switch--checked" role="switch" aria-checked="true">
          <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
        </button>
        <span class="aqua-switch-label">Enable AirPort</span>
      </div>
    `) %>

    <h3>Disabled</h3>
    <p>Add <code>.aqua-switch--disabled</code> (and the <code>disabled</code> attribute) to dim the switch and its label.</p>

    <%- example(`
      [[<div class="demo-row demo-row--tight">]]
        <div class="aqua-switch-wrapper">
          <button type="button" class="aqua-switch aqua-switch--disabled" role="switch" aria-checked="false" disabled>
            <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
          </button>
          <span class="aqua-switch-label">Bluetooth</span>
        </div>
        <div class="aqua-switch-wrapper">
          <button type="button" class="aqua-switch aqua-switch--checked aqua-switch--disabled" role="switch" aria-checked="true" disabled>
            <span class="aqua-switch-thumb"></span>
          </button>
          <span class="aqua-switch-label">AirPort</span>
        </div>
      [[</div>]]
    `) %>

